# Copy to .env.local and uncomment to override defaults.
# Bun loads .env.local automatically before every command — no extra config needed.

# Renderer selection (Electrobun)
# Default: bundled CEF (Chromium) on Linux/macOS — avoids WebKitGTK rendering bugs;
# the system WebView2 on Windows — no CEF bundle, much smaller installer.
# Set to "webkit" to use the system webview (WebKitGTK / WKWebView / WebView2),
# or "cef" to bundle CEF on Windows too.
# ROADRAVEN_RENDERER=webkit
